jack lantern pumpkin halloween quest~
&12Jack&00 &10O&00. &08Lantern&00~
&12A tall man with a head made out of a carved pumpkin stands here asking you to listen to his plea.&00
~
&12Jack&00 &10O&00. &08Lantern&00 tells you his tale: Every year on what you call Halloween the boundary 
between the realm of the living and the realm of the dead begins to break down and the 
spirits are again able to visit your land. On this day &08The Great Pumpkin&00 is reborn, and it is 
through this symbol of Halloween that the spirits are laid to rest once more. However, 
this year, the fiend &10Pumpkin Head&00 has kidnapped our leader &08The Great Pumpkin&00 before
he has been reborn and is weak, so the dead will never be bound away again. Please help 
us rescue our leader, or we will all be buried under a tide of the undead. The hordes of 
zombies and evil spirits invading your land are just a taste of what will happen if nothing 
is done. If we gather our strength and form a group at what you call 7pm Eastern Time on 
Halloween, we might be able to rescue our leader and prevent the destruction of your 
land.
~
